# W30, b (k7: phase 5, no key item 9): takes the gate to stag0201 while a's Dry Land instance has a stage group in stag0202
# only: I1a enters b into a's instance as a guest in a new stage group at stag0201 (a guest's NEW, 19.30.4): b's engine has
# a's story (key item 9) and settings, its own context; the toast names a's stage. b's gate disc: home on its own story,
# its online card and server story unchanged (counter-proof W30x: without the replace b keeps its own story in stag0201).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:9=1
log own story at home
idle until epoch>=@200
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until frames>=120 fail key:9=0
log b plays a's story
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=120 fail key:9=1
log own story again
